<span id="alg2.l17.3" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg2.l17.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Prune totally invalid nodes

</span>
</div>
