<span id="alg2.l19.5" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg2.l19.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Check for valid retention rule

</span>
